    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty heavy take. So if the goal is to actually achieve equity and dismantle those power structures, aren't you saying that a retributive system is inherently incompatible with modern justice? Does it even make sense to even consider \"balancing\" the two if one is fundamentally built on oppression and the other on healing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
